<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation Process | 6-Stage Motorcycle Shipping Workflow
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging protect my motorcycle during the Delhi‑to‑Mumbai transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system starts with an 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap that cushions minor impacts, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors that absorb shocks. Corrugated fiberboard sheets add structural rigidity, while stretch film seals the bike against weather. Custom wooden crates secure fragile parts, and a final outer layer of reinforced film prevents abrasions, collectively ensuring a scratch‑free journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for bike parcel service in Tirupur and Attur, and can they be used for a Delhi‑to‑Mumbai shipment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Both Tirupur and Attur bike parcel services require a valid government‑issued ID, vehicle registration certificate, insurance policy, and a signed transport agreement. These documents are universally accepted for any intercity move, including the Delhi‑to‑Mumbai route, as they satisfy IRCTC and bus carrier compliance standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the bike transport process insured, and what does the IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every bike transportation process is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy. It protects against accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards from the moment the bike leaves the doorstep until it is handed over at the destination, offering full declared‑value coverage for peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp system prevent scratches compared to traditional bike parcel by bus methods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp features a smooth, non‑abrasive surface and precise height control, allowing the bike to glide onto the trailer without contact with rough road surfaces. Traditional bus loading often uses manual ramps or stairs, increasing the risk of wheel or body scratches. Our system eliminates these risks, guaranteeing a pristine finish.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time during the 1499 km journey on NH 19?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each container truck is equipped with satellite GPS that provides live location updates via our customer portal. You can monitor the bike’s exact position, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations, ensuring full transparency throughout the entire Bike Transportation Process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the main cost factors influencing the bike transportation process between Delhi and Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Key cost drivers include distance (1499 km), vehicle type (hydraulic trailer vs. bus), insurance coverage level, fuel surcharge, and any additional services such as door‑to‑door pickup, fuel draining, or custom crating. Seasonal demand and toll charges on NH 19 can also affect the final quotation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad handle fuel draining and mirror protection without compromising my bike’s performance?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our technicians drain only the minimum fuel required for safe transport, sealing the tank to prevent leaks. Mirrors are wrapped with soft, anti‑scratch covers and secured with gentle clamps. All procedures follow manufacturer guidelines, ensuring the bike remains ready for immediate use upon delivery.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
